{"ex-502-1":{"id":"ex-502-1","chapter":"502","number":1,"title":"辨認同位素","question":"<p>以下顯示三種不同的核素。</p><p><sub>20</sub><sup>40</sup><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> <sub>20</sub><sup>46</sup><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>Q</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> <sub>22</sub><sup>46</sup><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>(a) 求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>Q</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的質子數和中子數。</p><p>(b) 哪兩種核素是同一元素的同位素？簡述原因。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 質子數目 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 20 中子數目 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> – <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 46 – 20 = 26</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的原子序數相同（都是 20），但質量數不同（分別是 40 和46），因此它們是同一元素的同位素。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_502_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"273cad9af4f871dc7b8f60761df754b1eaf517031ada9876fa60d312a817d517","segments":[{"page":6,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,475.7318951171875,557.4491,623.0479888916016],"text":"例 題 1 辨認同位素\r\n以下是三種不同的核素。\r\n40\r\n20P 46\r\n20Q 46\r\n22R\r\n(a) 求 Q 的質子和中子數目。\r\n(b) 哪兩種核素是同一元素的同位素？試簡單解釋。\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,623.0479888916016,557.4491,743.5848951171876],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 質子數目 = Z = 20\r\n中子數目 = A – Z = 46 – 20 = 26\r\n(b) P 和 Q 的原子序數相同（都是 20），但質量數不同（分別是 40 和\r\n46），因此它們是同一元素的同位素。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-502-2":{"id":"ex-502-2","chapter":"502","number":2,"title":"鐳-226 的 α 衰變","question":"<p>鐳-226（<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Ra</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>）放出一個 α 粒子，衰變為氡（Rn）。寫出此衰變過程的方程。</p>","answer":"<p>α 衰變可寫成：</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Ra</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> → <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Z</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Rn</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>He</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>考慮衰變前後的質量數與原子序。</p><p>226 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + 4 88 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>Z</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + 2</p><p>以及</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 222 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>Z</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 86</p><p>因此，方程為</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Ra</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> → <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Rn</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>He</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_502_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"273cad9af4f871dc7b8f60761df754b1eaf517031ada9876fa60d312a817d517","segments":[{"page":10,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,459.82889511718747,557.6491,554.1448974609375],"text":"例 題 2 鐳-226 的 α 衰變\r\n鐳-226 ( 226\r\n88Ra) 放射出一個 α 粒子，衰變成氡 (Rn)。試寫出這個衰變\r\n的方程。\r\n"},{"page":10,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,554.1448974609375,557.6491,743.3698951171875],"text":"題解\r\n上述 α 衰變可以寫成：\r\n 226\r\n88Ra → A\r\nZRn + 4\r\n2He\r\n考慮衰變前和衰變後的質量數和原子序數。\r\n226 = A + 4 和 88 = Z + 2\r\nA = 222 Z = 86\r\n因此，方程可寫成：\r\n 226\r\n88Ra → 222\r\n86Rn + 4\r\n2He\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-502-3":{"id":"ex-502-3","chapter":"502","number":3,"title":"鈾-235 的衰變系","question":"<p>以下顯示鈾-235 的衰變系列。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/94c23423c21fc91d96f09002.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:347.9px\"></p><p>(a) 上述每次衰變會放出哪一種粒子？</p><p>(b) 衰變系列以穩定的鉛-207（<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Pb</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>）結束。整個系列共放出多少個 α 粒子和 β 粒子？</p><p>(c) 能否從上圖推斷此衰變系列有沒有放出 γ 輻射？解釋你的答案。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>U</mtext></mrow><mover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>→</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>α</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mover><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Th</mtext></mrow><mover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>→</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>β</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mover><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Pa</mtext></mrow><mover><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>→</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>α</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mover><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Ac</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>→</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>⋯</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>(b) 放出的 α 粒子數目</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>質量數的改變</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>α 粒子的質量數</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>衰變系列可寫成：</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>U</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>→</mtext></mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Pb</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>He</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>y</mtext></mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>考慮原子序。</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>y</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>y</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>整個系列共放出四個 β 粒子。</p><p>(c) 不能。γ 發射不涉及原子序或質量數的改變，因此無法在圖上顯示。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>α 衰變會改變質量數，β 衰變或 γ 發射則不會。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_502_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"273cad9af4f871dc7b8f60761df754b1eaf517031ada9876fa60d312a817d517","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,423.78509521484375],"text":"例 題 3 鈾-235 的衰變系\r\n下圖顯示鈾-235 的衰變系。\r\n88 89 90 91 92 93\r\n223\r\n227\r\n235\r\n231\r\n239\r\nU\r\nTh Pa\r\nAc\r\n原子序數\r\n質量數\r\n(a) 上圖所示的幾次衰變，每次放射出甚麼粒子？\r\n(b) 衰變系最終會變成穩定的鉛-207 ( 207\r\n82Pb)。整個衰變系共放射出多\r\n少個 α 粒子和 β 粒子？\r\n(c) 可否從上圖推斷出衰變系有沒有放出 γ 輻射？試扼要解釋答案。\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,423.78509521484375,562.4491,750.6688951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 235\r\n92U 231\r\n90Th 231\r\n91Pa 227\r\n89Ac ···\r\n(b) 放射出 α 粒子的數目\r\n = 質量數的改變\r\nα 粒子的質量數\r\n = 235 − 207\r\n4\r\n = 7\r\n衰變系可以寫成：\r\n 235\r\n92U 207\r\n82Pb + 7 4\r\n2He + y 0\r\n−1 e\r\n考慮原子序數。\r\n 92 = 82 + 7 × 2 + y × (–1)\r\n y = 4\r\n整個衰變系共放射出 4 個 β 粒子。\r\n(c) 無法推斷。γ 發射並不會改變原子序數和質量數，因此不能在圖中\r\n顯示。\r\nα β α\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718752,181.4491,750.6688951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n質量數在 α 衰變中會改\r\n變，在 β 衰變或 γ 發射中\r\n則不會。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-502-4":{"id":"ex-502-4","chapter":"502","number":4,"title":"從計數率找出半衰期","question":"<p>蓋革 — 彌勒計數器量度鈉 -24 樣本在一段時間內的計數率。下圖顯示計數率怎樣隨時間改變。鈉 -24 會衰變成穩定的產物。</p><p>(a) 為甚麼圖線在一段時間後會趨向水平，但卻不會下降至零？</p><p>(b) 從線圖估算鈉 -24 的半衰期。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/11dd19f7ac089b869b22ce57.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:445.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 一段時間後，樣本的放射強度差不多下降至零，蓋革 — 彌勒計數器所量得的計數率來自本底輻射。</p><p>(b) 本底輻射的計數率 = 每分鐘 40 次樣本的初始計數率 = 400 – 40 = 每分鐘 360 次當 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>½</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{½}</annotation></semantics></math></span>,</p><p>量得的計數率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>360</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{360}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + 40 = 每分鐘 220 次</p><p>根據線圖，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>½</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{½}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 15 小時</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_502_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"273cad9af4f871dc7b8f60761df754b1eaf517031ada9876fa60d312a817d517","segments":[{"page":19,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718752,562.4491,372.86688232421875],"text":"例 題 4 從計數率找出半衰期\r\n蓋革—彌勒計數器量度鈉-24 樣本在一段時間內的計數率。下圖顯示\r\n計數率怎樣隨時間改變。鈉-24 會衰變成穩定的產物。\r\n0\r\n100\r\n200\r\n300\r\n400\r\n15 30 45 60 75 90 105 120\r\n每分鐘次數\r\n時間 / 小時\r\n(a) 為甚麼圖線在一段時間後會趨向水平，但卻不會下降至零？\r\n(b) 從線圖估算鈉-24 的半衰期。\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,372.86688232421875,562.4491,584.4038951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 一段時間後，樣本的放射強度差不多下降至零，蓋革—彌勒計數\r\n器所量得的計數率來自本底輻射。\r\n(b) 本底輻射的計數率 = 每分鐘 40 次\r\n樣本的初始計數率 = 400 – 40 = 每分鐘 360 次\r\n當 t = t½,\r\n量得的計數率 = 360\r\n2\r\n + 40 = 每分鐘 220 次\r\n根據線圖，\r\nt½ = 15 小時\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-502-5":{"id":"ex-502-5","chapter":"502","number":5,"title":"放射強度與半衰期","question":"<p>鈉 -24 會衰變成穩定的產物。它的衰變常數為 1.28 × 10<sup>–5</sup> s<sup>–1</sup>，半衰期為 15 小時。某個鈉 -24 樣本的放射強度為 8 × 10<sup>5</sup> Bq。</p><p>(a) 求樣本中未衰變原子核的數目。</p><p>(b) 在 45 小時後，樣本的放射強度是多少？</p><p>(c) 求放射強度減少至 2.5 × 10<sup>4</sup> Bq 所需的時間。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.o